entries[166752] = { ["name"] = "Stone Guard's Bladed Cloak", ["text"] = "Heirloom Upgrade Level: 0/0\nBinds to Warband\nBack\n6 Armor\n+6 [Agility or Strength or Intellect]\n+9 Stamina\n+ 6 Haste\n+ 6 Versatility\nRequires any Horde race\nRequires level 1 to 29 ( 29)\n\"A commonly-issued cloak for new recruits in the war.\"\n\nRegalia of Fabled Adventurers (0/7)\nHeirloom Chestpiece\nHeirloom Helm\nHeirloom Shoulders\nHeirloom Cloak\nHeirloom Legs\nHeirloom Necklace\nHeirloom Ring\n(2) Set : Rested experience consumed is reduced by 30%.\n(3) Set : Increases your out-of-combat regeneration in the outdoors, normal dungeons and battlegrounds.\n(5) Set : Gaining a level triggers Burst of Knowledge, dealing 1126 Holy damage to nearby enemies and granting you 40% Primary Stat for 2 min. Defeating enemies extends this effect, up to an additional 2 min.\n(6) Set : Rested experience consumed is reduced by an additional 30%.\n\nVendor:\nProvisioner Mukra\nZone:\nZuldazar" }
